{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51272","headline":"赠江油尉 · 李白","name":"赠江油尉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岚光深院里，傍砌水泠泠。\n野燕巢官舍。\n溪云入[古]厅。\n日斜孤吏过，帘卷乱峯青。\n五色神仙尉，焚香读道经。\n（杨慎《全蜀艺文志》）（见《蜀中名胜记》卷十，云此诗「爲米芾书，刻在县卫」。\n「古」字据此书补。\n吴企明谓此诗中「五色神仙尉」一句，用《北梦琐言》卷十二所载张裼之子闻说壁鱼入道经函，因蠹食神仙字身有五色，吞之可成仙的典故，因疑此诗爲晚唐人或宋人所假托。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51272.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51272","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}